      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You must collect only the personal data strictly necessary for order processing and keep it securely stored with limited access. Be transparent with customers about why you hold their email and address, and allow them to easily correct, delete, or withdraw their consent at any time. For an audit, maintain clear records of how long you retain order data and ensure those records are encrypted if stored digitally.",
