    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That 72-hour window sounds pretty intense. It's kind of scary thinking about these little things happening in the background where you can't see them. Are there any specific ways to keep an eye out for those types of \"hidden\" or sneaky little issues before they become a problem? I just want to make sure nothing is lurking in our systems unnoticed.",
