      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To stay ahead of unauthorized access, you should implement strong access controls, such as multi-factor authentication and role-based permissions, to prevent leaks and ensure only authorized staff can view data. Regularly rotate passwords and monitor log files for unusual activity can help you detect potential intrusions before they escalate into major breaches. Since audits check for active security measures, document your testing schedule and keep incident reports accessible to show proactive monitoring.",
